What is the output of the following package-private demonstration?
```java
class WorkerUnit {
    int tasks = 5;
}
class TeamLead extends WorkerUnit {
    int getTotal() {
        return tasks + 2;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        TeamLead tl = new TeamLead();
        System.out.println(tl.getTotal());
    }
}
```

