What is the output of the following nested member access snippet?
```java
class EnclosingScope {
    private int key = 88;
    class NestedScope {
        int getKey() {
            return key;
        }
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        EnclosingScope enc = new EnclosingScope();
        EnclosingScope.NestedScope nest = enc.new NestedScope();
        System.out.println(nest.getKey());
    }
}
```

